WEBVTT

01:40.080 --> 01:43.020
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.100 --> 01:46.000
[Episode 5]

01:59.990 --> 02:00.790
Sister,

02:03.500 --> 02:05.240
why do you want to kill me?

02:13.640 --> 02:14.620
Sister,

02:16.670 --> 02:18.170
you misunderstood me.

02:20.600 --> 02:21.700
Brother,

02:22.750 --> 02:24.810
you're unforgivable.

02:26.130 --> 02:27.620
Don't blame me.

03:08.790 --> 03:10.720
You actually have the guts to come.

03:11.310 --> 03:12.400
If I didn't come,

03:12.670 --> 03:14.160
they would be in danger.

03:14.240 --> 03:15.830
You colluded with Ran Yi.

03:15.870 --> 03:17.990
That's what put them in danger.

03:19.710 --> 03:20.510
Colluded?

03:21.270 --> 03:23.420
Mr. Zhuo, your words are so harsh.

03:23.730 --> 03:25.630
Ran Yi and I just collaborated

03:25.760 --> 03:27.460
to get what we need.

03:27.650 --> 03:29.710
When you came to the Demon Hunting Bureau,

03:29.710 --> 03:31.950
you also said you wanted to collaborate with us.

03:31.950 --> 03:34.260
Which part of what you said

03:34.350 --> 03:35.690
is true?

03:36.230 --> 03:38.030
Mr. Zhuo, every word I said to you

03:38.030 --> 03:39.930
is true.

03:40.140 --> 03:41.850
I only lie to little girls.

03:41.960 --> 03:42.910
Nonsense.

03:46.760 --> 03:47.310
You...

03:49.430 --> 03:51.910
I can tell you the details.

03:52.070 --> 03:53.579
But if we don't save them now,

03:53.579 --> 03:55.030
it'll be too late.

04:23.870 --> 04:26.680
Then... how can we deal with Ran Yi?

04:27.030 --> 04:30.030
Actually, there's another way, which is the easiest.

04:31.070 --> 04:32.500
Make the dreamers

04:32.990 --> 04:34.570
die in their dreams.

04:34.750 --> 04:35.850
So easy?

04:35.990 --> 04:37.650
They can just commit suicide.

04:37.830 --> 04:39.750
Committing suicide is indeed easy,

04:39.750 --> 04:41.250
but not everyone

04:41.470 --> 04:43.200
has the guts to commit suicide.

04:44.110 --> 04:45.550
Will you commit suicide now?

04:45.550 --> 04:47.140
Why would I commit suicide?

04:47.310 --> 04:49.470
I'm not in a dream created by Ran Yi.

04:49.830 --> 04:51.030
Are you sure?

04:51.570 --> 04:53.090
How can you be sure?

05:19.120 --> 05:21.450
Looks like you've started to understand.

05:22.110 --> 05:23.500
If there's something

05:23.670 --> 05:25.990
that can penetrate the dreams created by Ran Yi,

05:25.990 --> 05:26.790
maybe...

05:26.790 --> 05:28.030
As far as I know,

05:28.830 --> 05:29.960
nothing can do that.

05:44.070 --> 05:45.370
The Cloud Light Sword

05:45.400 --> 05:46.830
can kill demons and evil spirits.

05:46.830 --> 05:48.760
It won't be tainted by evil spirits

05:48.870 --> 05:51.820
and can break all the illusions in the world.

07:38.550 --> 07:41.080
Why can't Wen Xiao hear the sound of the sword?

07:46.390 --> 07:47.190
Forget it.

07:48.560 --> 07:50.360
I'll go look for her in the dream.

08:43.070 --> 08:44.280
Don't be afraid.

08:46.370 --> 08:47.700
Demons and evil spirits

08:48.040 --> 08:49.670
are just illusions.

08:49.870 --> 08:52.020
Everything is not real.

08:52.320 --> 08:53.800
You just need to wake up.

08:57.230 --> 08:59.120
What should I do to wake up?

09:01.430 --> 09:02.510
To wake up...

09:54.730 --> 09:55.850
That was...

10:06.170 --> 10:07.570
A dream created by Ran Yi.

10:21.390 --> 10:23.020
You didn't fall into a dream?

10:26.750 --> 10:28.490
I don't know why either.

10:31.900 --> 10:32.740
Ms. Pei.

10:35.510 --> 10:36.610
What's going on?

10:38.490 --> 10:41.550
This is the backfire from Ran Yi's dream control magic.

10:41.800 --> 10:43.090
Dreamers

10:43.540 --> 10:45.760
having a stronger obsession with the illusions in their dreams

10:45.760 --> 10:47.240
would suffer

10:47.320 --> 10:48.780
greater physical damage.

10:51.470 --> 10:53.390
How come I haven't been affected?

10:55.750 --> 10:56.760
My obsession...

11:00.030 --> 11:01.400
It's indeed very strange.

11:01.400 --> 11:03.260
Even Ms. Pei, who has practiced martial arts for years,

11:03.260 --> 11:04.590
failed to withstand it.

11:05.230 --> 11:07.290
You've always been physically weak,

11:07.380 --> 11:08.870
but you're fine this time.

11:15.530 --> 11:16.710
Zhao Yuanzhou,

11:16.990 --> 11:19.220
now we should have a good talk.

11:19.840 --> 11:21.770
The one you should talk to is not me,

11:24.730 --> 11:25.970
but Ran Yi.

11:28.840 --> 11:30.220
He really is here.

11:32.080 --> 11:33.710
Don't waste time.

11:33.970 --> 11:35.870
Let's go find him.

11:39.210 --> 11:40.160
Ms. Pei!

11:41.790 --> 11:42.960
What's wrong?

11:48.400 --> 11:49.960
I'll take you to Ran Yi.

11:49.980 --> 11:51.700
But Ms. Pei, stop acting tough.

11:51.700 --> 11:53.240
Just stay here.

11:53.260 --> 11:54.920
Save us some trouble.

11:55.790 --> 11:56.590
I can't just let them

11:56.590 --> 11:57.850
go with you.

11:58.680 --> 11:59.310
Who knows

11:59.310 --> 12:01.690
if you'll lure them into another trap?

12:18.490 --> 12:20.260
When I had nightmares,

12:21.300 --> 12:23.710
my father would always write different Chinese characters

12:23.710 --> 12:25.290
in my palm.

12:25.870 --> 12:28.070
He said as long as I held onto it tightly,

12:28.490 --> 12:30.370
it would dispel the bad dreams.

12:36.100 --> 12:36.950
Don't worry.

12:37.560 --> 12:39.670
I have a way to deal with the great demon.

12:39.670 --> 12:41.070
Everything will be fine.

12:44.780 --> 12:46.910
You always had nightmares in the past?

12:56.240 --> 12:57.510
Jiu asked me

12:57.670 --> 12:59.870
to take this bottle of medicine with me.

13:00.190 --> 13:01.250
Take it.

13:01.390 --> 13:03.720
It should help with your internal injury.

13:15.240 --> 13:16.410
Thank you.

13:22.460 --> 13:23.740
Well, well, well.

13:23.990 --> 13:25.470
You're helping each other.

13:25.470 --> 13:27.530
You guys share a deep bond.

13:27.870 --> 13:29.770
You're doing this in front of me, huh?

13:29.770 --> 13:31.230
You think I'll lose to you?

13:41.080 --> 13:41.960
Protect.

13:46.310 --> 13:48.510
This barrier can protect her.

13:48.540 --> 13:50.210
It's much more practical than

13:50.560 --> 13:51.890
your Chinese character

13:52.290 --> 13:53.370
and your medicine.

13:54.270 --> 13:54.830
You...

13:55.310 --> 13:56.390
Let's go.

15:16.870 --> 15:18.130
The Cloud Light Sword.

15:21.330 --> 15:23.290
It's been over ten years.

15:24.440 --> 15:26.290
I didn't expect to see it again.

15:27.190 --> 15:28.460
Over ten years?

15:29.930 --> 15:31.250
You know my brother?

15:33.540 --> 15:34.880
More than ten years ago,

15:35.280 --> 15:36.790
I came to the mortal world.

15:37.020 --> 15:39.940
I met a man holding the Cloud Light Sword.

15:40.190 --> 15:41.350
He saved me.

15:43.550 --> 15:45.310
It turns out he is your brother.

15:46.020 --> 15:48.370
But the Cloud Light Sword he was holding

15:48.790 --> 15:51.120
was not as powerful as the one in your hand.

15:51.830 --> 15:53.400
He told me

15:53.450 --> 15:55.370
he had a beloved younger brother

15:56.200 --> 15:58.200
haunted by nightmares every night.

15:59.190 --> 16:00.850
He asked me if I could help him.

16:02.270 --> 16:04.180
I gave him a scale of mine

16:04.590 --> 16:08.120
telling him to grind it into powder and mix it with water to take.

16:08.150 --> 16:08.990
After that,

16:09.190 --> 16:10.070
his younger brother

16:10.070 --> 16:12.220
was no longer troubled by nightmares

16:12.720 --> 16:14.580
and was no longer afraid anymore.

16:16.230 --> 16:17.030
Brother,

16:18.470 --> 16:19.730
I dare not fall asleep.

16:21.590 --> 16:22.520
If I fall asleep,

16:22.590 --> 16:25.050
I would dream of myself turning into a demon.

16:26.130 --> 16:28.150
No one would play with me.

16:30.360 --> 16:31.430
It's okay.

16:32.640 --> 16:34.900
Dreams reflect the opposite of reality.

16:38.600 --> 16:39.890
I'm here.

16:40.980 --> 16:41.910
Don't be afraid.

16:42.880 --> 16:47.170
♫Footsteps echo, one by one♫

16:47.200 --> 16:49.970
♫Sorrows scattered, lost to the wind♫

16:51.410 --> 16:55.230
♫Not forgetting, nor dwelling on♫

16:55.510 --> 16:58.430
♫The way back home♫

16:59.140 --> 17:00.730
♫With strong will♫

17:01.180 --> 17:04.720
♫I slowly carve out♫

17:05.319 --> 17:07.050
♫Growth♫

17:07.640 --> 17:09.069
♫Turning back♫

17:09.710 --> 17:13.030
♫I find you still in that familiar place♫

17:13.950 --> 17:15.560
♫Waiting there♫

17:20.270 --> 17:21.859
I see.

17:22.530 --> 17:23.349
So, Zhuo,

17:23.349 --> 17:25.670
that's why you haven't dreamed

17:26.390 --> 17:27.430
all these years.

17:37.450 --> 17:39.090
You had a good brother.

17:41.550 --> 17:42.650
Unfortunately...

17:45.230 --> 17:46.440
I killed him.

17:52.630 --> 17:54.560
My brother didn't want me to dream.

17:56.390 --> 17:57.640
But Zhao Yuanzhou,

17:58.450 --> 17:59.940
you killed them.

18:00.650 --> 18:01.930
You have imprisoned me

18:02.470 --> 18:04.270
in a nightmare for so many years.

18:05.210 --> 18:07.010
When you kill me one day,

18:07.870 --> 18:10.130
you can wake up from the nightmare.

18:19.310 --> 18:21.130
But you know it's not today

18:22.010 --> 18:23.350
or now.

18:26.750 --> 18:28.060
Then tell me,

18:29.110 --> 18:30.770
why did you help Ran Yi?

18:33.090 --> 18:34.550
Interesting.

18:37.780 --> 18:39.700
You humans call it a virtue

18:41.070 --> 18:42.580
when you help one another.

18:43.110 --> 18:45.060
But for us demons,

18:45.090 --> 18:47.220
helping each other requires a reason.

18:47.740 --> 18:49.670
You always inflict harm on demons,

18:49.870 --> 18:52.670
but you can always come up with excuses.

18:54.310 --> 18:55.170
Zhao Yuanzhou,

18:56.070 --> 18:57.640
I told you this long ago.

18:57.870 --> 18:59.080
Humans and demons

18:59.190 --> 19:01.030
can never get along well.

19:03.470 --> 19:04.340
Really?

19:06.300 --> 19:07.030
Then why do you

19:07.030 --> 19:09.230
insist on being with Miss Qi?

19:14.510 --> 19:17.150
I told you Wen Xiao and Mr. Zhuo are smart.

19:17.870 --> 19:19.400
You can't hide it from them.

19:20.190 --> 19:21.230
Where's Miss Qi?

19:22.990 --> 19:24.830
My daughter was so frightened

19:24.830 --> 19:26.030
that she caught a cold.

19:26.030 --> 19:28.230
It's not convenient for her to meet you.

20:19.740 --> 20:21.180
Who are you guys?

20:23.110 --> 20:24.710
Why did you save me?

20:26.670 --> 20:28.620
Why didn't you let me die?

20:31.260 --> 20:32.560
It's easy to die,

20:33.840 --> 20:35.570
but it can't solve any problem.

20:37.030 --> 20:40.230
It will only hurt the feelings of those who care about you.

20:49.820 --> 20:51.470
In the boundless azure sea,

20:52.660 --> 20:54.110
there is no path.

20:55.590 --> 20:57.470
Yet in the mortal world,

21:00.610 --> 21:02.610
in the vastness of the starry river,

21:03.000 --> 21:04.580
I hold your hand,

21:06.440 --> 21:08.570
traveling around the world together.

21:22.030 --> 21:25.030
The only person caring about me also died.

21:25.050 --> 21:27.050
Why should I live?

21:28.100 --> 21:29.350
Ran Yi Fish?

21:31.330 --> 21:32.860
Is the person you mentioned

21:33.160 --> 21:34.680
Ran Yi?

21:36.540 --> 21:38.160
You know him?

21:43.110 --> 21:44.230
He's not dead.

21:47.880 --> 21:49.700
We can take you to him.

21:52.190 --> 21:53.720
You actually put her in a sack?

21:53.720 --> 21:54.910
This is not Miss Qi.

21:55.790 --> 21:56.790
This is Master Qi.

22:01.030 --> 22:02.430
We just caught him

22:02.430 --> 22:04.690
and didn't have time to interrogate him.

22:05.110 --> 22:07.370
He's still in the dream created by Ran Yi.

22:08.750 --> 22:09.910
He deserves it.

22:11.550 --> 22:13.220
He can never wake up.

22:14.950 --> 22:16.310
Master Qi is guilty,

22:17.740 --> 22:20.680
but he should be convicted by the Demon Hunting Bureau.

22:20.680 --> 22:23.740
Demons can't abuse your power out of personal grudges.

22:24.900 --> 22:25.700
What?

22:26.710 --> 22:28.350
When he asked the demon hunter

22:28.350 --> 22:29.150
to perform the cruel

22:29.150 --> 22:31.820
corpse-dissolving and demon-subduing technique on me,

22:31.820 --> 22:33.720
wasn't he abusing his power?

22:33.910 --> 22:35.510
Why didn't you mention that?

22:37.740 --> 22:39.740
Why is the incense burner so smelly?

22:44.570 --> 22:45.470
This is...

22:46.370 --> 22:48.570
the smell of the Demon Slaying Spell.

22:59.860 --> 23:02.990
The corpse-dissolving and demon-subduing technique.

23:03.630 --> 23:06.120
Crush a dragon's rib bones into powder,

23:06.460 --> 23:08.120
soak it in lime water,

23:08.440 --> 23:10.050
and dry it into incense.

23:11.080 --> 23:12.150
After it's burnt,

23:12.950 --> 23:14.550
it can kill aquatic animals.

23:23.590 --> 23:25.250
I promised Miss Qi

23:25.550 --> 23:27.150
to take her to the Wilderness

23:27.470 --> 23:28.970
to see the Tree of Heaven

23:29.630 --> 23:31.030
and the shores of the sea.

23:33.990 --> 23:35.590
In the boundless azure sea,

23:37.170 --> 23:38.510
there is no path.

23:41.790 --> 23:42.950
Yet

23:45.070 --> 23:46.200
in the mortal world,

24:04.290 --> 24:05.850
♫A light flickers♫

24:04.400 --> 24:05.930
in the vastness of the starry river,

24:05.930 --> 24:07.070
I hold your hand,

24:06.030 --> 24:08.710
♫Far in the distance♫

24:08.260 --> 24:09.220
traveling around

24:08.890 --> 24:10.020
♫Scars♫

24:10.570 --> 24:13.040
♫Nourished gently by rain♫

24:10.630 --> 24:11.500
the world together.

24:11.500 --> 24:15.500
[In the boundless azure sea, there is no path. Yet in the mortal world, in the vastness of the starry river, I hold your hand, traveling around the world together.]

24:13.410 --> 24:14.920
♫The window opened by the wind♫

24:14.980 --> 24:16.260
♫Softly sways♫

24:16.340 --> 24:19.630
♫But time slips away♫

24:20.040 --> 24:22.530
♫Hastily♫

24:22.650 --> 24:26.830
♫You wear candlelight like a robe, awaiting dawn♫

24:27.120 --> 24:31.330
♫While I cradle heartache, year after year, on and on♫

24:31.750 --> 24:33.350
♫In dreams, my hometown♫

24:33.420 --> 24:34.310
♫Lies under frost♫

24:34.420 --> 24:37.920
♫All sounds♫

24:38.600 --> 24:40.450
♫Are lost♫

24:40.780 --> 24:45.620
♫The wind brushes against rivers and hills♫

24:45.660 --> 24:49.480
♫Wild blooms refuse to fall♫

24:49.520 --> 24:54.660
♫They've seen every hue the world has borne♫

24:54.730 --> 24:58.610
♫Which blossom is meant for me?♫

24:59.190 --> 25:03.740
♫As songs are sung, how many truly understand?♫

25:04.080 --> 25:07.590
♫The varied regrets we sing repeatedly♫

25:08.040 --> 25:10.780
♫Have echoed for years♫

25:11.070 --> 25:15.720
♫Hoping fate will amend♫

25:16.200 --> 25:20.130
♫Remember me, a humble♫

25:21.050 --> 25:22.320
♫Blossom♫

25:25.590 --> 25:26.810
I'll take you away.

25:26.950 --> 25:27.750
Where?

25:27.770 --> 25:29.550
I'll take you to the Wilderness,

25:29.550 --> 25:31.350
although it's a desolate place.

25:31.410 --> 25:32.840
No place

25:32.950 --> 25:34.550
is more desolate than this world.

25:34.550 --> 25:35.270
Master,

25:35.290 --> 25:35.930
bad news!

25:35.960 --> 25:37.220
Miss Qi ran away with the doctor!

25:37.220 --> 25:37.750
This way.

25:45.140 --> 25:46.440
I'm a demon hunter!

25:46.470 --> 25:47.190
Demon!

25:47.210 --> 25:48.640
Show your true form!

26:33.870 --> 26:35.010
My Lady!

26:36.060 --> 26:36.790
I'll marry that man.

26:36.790 --> 26:37.920
I'll marry that man!

26:38.000 --> 26:38.470
Father!

26:38.470 --> 26:39.120
Father!

26:39.310 --> 26:40.350
Let him go!

26:40.350 --> 26:41.590
I'll marry that man!

26:42.230 --> 26:43.390
No!

27:07.490 --> 27:09.850
To prevent me from going back to Miss Qi,

27:10.230 --> 27:14.710
he kept the corpse-dissolving and demon-subduing incense burnt in the mansion.

27:14.710 --> 27:16.320
I couldn't save her.

27:17.790 --> 27:19.690
So you ran away, seriously injured

27:19.690 --> 27:21.550
and with little time left to live.

27:21.630 --> 27:22.990
In order to restore your demon power,

27:22.990 --> 27:26.250
you could only absorb malicious energy by killing people.

27:26.750 --> 27:27.980
Also,

27:28.110 --> 27:29.680
you deliberately preyed on brides

27:29.680 --> 27:30.970
and created panic,

27:31.210 --> 27:32.920
making people dare not get married.

27:32.920 --> 27:36.780
You did everything in an attempt to stop Miss Qi from getting married.

27:37.500 --> 27:39.220
I could stop anyone,

27:39.590 --> 27:40.670
but I couldn't stop

27:40.670 --> 27:42.350
her despicable father.

27:43.430 --> 27:45.350
It's God's will that he

27:46.260 --> 27:47.700
ended up like this.

27:51.060 --> 27:51.830
I don't know how

27:51.830 --> 27:53.630
to undo the dream control magic.

27:54.750 --> 27:56.010
And it can't be undone.

27:59.610 --> 28:01.010
It's very easy to undo it.

28:02.160 --> 28:03.200
Cut a piece

28:03.240 --> 28:03.910
of your meat

28:03.910 --> 28:05.400
and make him eat it.

28:12.710 --> 28:14.260
Don't bother.

28:14.710 --> 28:16.060
I'll wake him up.

28:25.270 --> 28:27.990
Give my life back to me.

28:29.530 --> 28:31.410
It's so cold down here.

28:31.990 --> 28:33.950
Come and accompany me.

28:35.410 --> 28:36.820
Leave me alone.

28:36.850 --> 28:38.860
You should go to that demon.

28:39.150 --> 28:41.360
You helped my daughter elope with him.

28:41.730 --> 28:43.260
You deserved to die!

28:51.070 --> 28:53.880
You do deserve to die!

28:55.640 --> 28:56.560
Wake up.

29:04.120 --> 29:05.660
Don't... Don't kill me!

29:05.920 --> 29:07.650
Don't... Don't come near me!

29:07.790 --> 29:08.820
Neither do you!

29:09.720 --> 29:11.920
Don't... Don't come near me. All of you.

29:13.180 --> 29:14.290
I didn't kill you.

29:14.320 --> 29:15.160
Don't come near me!

29:15.160 --> 29:16.280
Don't come near me!

29:16.300 --> 29:17.290
He's gone crazy.

29:17.330 --> 29:18.040
Go away!

29:18.060 --> 29:19.540
It has nothing to do with me.

29:19.540 --> 29:20.770
I didn't kill you.

29:20.990 --> 29:21.310
I didn't...

29:21.310 --> 29:22.030
Quiet.

29:26.830 --> 29:28.640
It was really him who killed them and buried the bodies.

29:28.640 --> 29:29.870
When my Cloud Light Sword

29:29.870 --> 29:31.450
was glimmering in Qi's Mansion,

29:31.450 --> 29:33.850
I felt something was wrong with that place.

30:09.630 --> 30:11.410
It was once a well.

30:11.440 --> 30:12.970
He moved a tree there

30:12.990 --> 30:14.450
to cover the well's mouth.

30:14.900 --> 30:16.180
But beneath the tree

30:16.200 --> 30:17.870
lies a hollow, deep well.

30:18.080 --> 30:20.210
The roots couldn't get any nutrients.

30:20.220 --> 30:21.170
As a result,

30:21.200 --> 30:22.260
the tree withered.

30:28.390 --> 30:29.310
One.

30:30.350 --> 30:31.280
Two.

30:32.040 --> 30:32.690
Three.

30:33.390 --> 30:34.110
Four.

30:35.090 --> 30:35.960
Five.

30:37.230 --> 30:38.900
All the five bodies in the well

30:39.320 --> 30:40.780
have been pulled out of it.

30:43.940 --> 30:45.390
The people in the well

30:45.430 --> 30:46.230
were the servants

30:46.230 --> 30:48.750
who wanted to help me elope with Miss Qi.

30:49.620 --> 30:50.830
To him, killing them

30:52.380 --> 30:54.430
is like killing a few ants.

30:57.500 --> 30:59.900
They must have died with great resentment.

31:00.670 --> 31:02.640
The greater resentment they died with,

31:02.640 --> 31:05.090
the more malicious energy there should be in the courtyard.

31:05.090 --> 31:05.800
But

31:06.010 --> 31:07.140
my Cloud Light Sword

31:07.170 --> 31:09.200
only sensed a faint trace of it.

31:10.130 --> 31:12.320
This has aroused my suspicion.

31:15.210 --> 31:16.060
Someone

31:16.270 --> 31:18.070
absorbed the malicious energy.

31:24.130 --> 31:25.990
Are you suspecting me?

31:27.120 --> 31:28.710
I'm not suspecting you.

31:29.070 --> 31:30.830
I'm sure it was you.

31:33.370 --> 31:34.850
Before you went to the Demon Hunting Bureau

31:34.850 --> 31:36.840
to tell us you would help us catch Ran Yi,

31:36.840 --> 31:38.980
you had already been to Qi's Mansion

31:39.010 --> 31:41.270
and found out Ran Yi committed the crime.

31:41.520 --> 31:42.740
A servant of Qi's Mansion

31:42.740 --> 31:43.510
said that a few days ago,

31:43.510 --> 31:44.740
he saw a ghost

31:44.740 --> 31:46.450
on the tree in the courtyard.

31:48.720 --> 31:49.520
Who is it?

31:50.750 --> 31:52.020
Who's there?

32:02.810 --> 32:04.010
Ghost!

32:05.190 --> 32:07.630
That ghost had a pair of red eyes.

32:07.790 --> 32:08.620
I think it was you,

32:08.620 --> 32:09.420
right?

32:09.960 --> 32:11.060
Zhao Yuanzhou.

32:14.410 --> 32:15.400
At that time,

32:15.440 --> 32:17.480
you absorbed the malicious energy in the well

32:17.480 --> 32:19.130
and discovered everything.

32:19.450 --> 32:21.650
Then you started to carry out your plan.

32:48.280 --> 32:49.340
Zhu Yan,

32:50.030 --> 32:52.360
I won't go back to the Wilderness with you.

32:52.770 --> 32:54.640
The Baize Token has been lost.

32:55.760 --> 32:58.150
Why are you being nosy here?

33:00.260 --> 33:03.120
Who said I'm here to take you back to the Wilderness?

33:04.410 --> 33:06.060
I'm here to help you.

33:07.110 --> 33:08.370
You offered

33:08.400 --> 33:11.010
to help him put the Water Ghost's wedding letter

33:11.010 --> 33:12.220
in Qi's Mansion.

33:13.170 --> 33:14.590
You don't need to deny it.

33:15.660 --> 33:16.920
On the wedding letter,

33:16.930 --> 33:18.930
there was familiar demonic energy,

33:19.180 --> 33:21.110
which is annoying.

33:24.010 --> 33:26.610
Mr. Zhuo, I didn't expect you to be so familiar

33:26.630 --> 33:27.990
with my demonic energy.

33:29.770 --> 33:31.830
Indeed, I placed the wedding letter.

33:57.440 --> 33:58.160
[Wedding Letter]

34:12.449 --> 34:14.040
Unexpectedly,

34:14.320 --> 34:16.770
Master Qi disregarded familial bonds.

34:18.719 --> 34:20.340
But I'm curious.

34:20.630 --> 34:23.199
Why didn't you take Miss Qi to him directly?

34:23.219 --> 34:25.210
Why did you make such a long detour?

34:27.370 --> 34:29.179
I was too ashamed to see her.

34:31.870 --> 34:33.530
I killed so many people.

34:34.909 --> 34:36.360
I'm guilty.

34:38.070 --> 34:39.739
But she is kind-hearted.

34:40.440 --> 34:42.000
She must care a lot

34:42.949 --> 34:44.630
about what I did.

34:45.530 --> 34:46.230
I just hope

34:46.230 --> 34:47.110
she won't be forced

34:47.110 --> 34:49.219
to marry someone she doesn't like.

34:53.900 --> 34:56.780
I hope she can live the life she wants.

34:58.320 --> 35:00.380
I'll take her here

35:01.440 --> 35:03.220
so that you can elope together.

35:04.560 --> 35:05.650
Isn't it good?

35:09.020 --> 35:10.620
I'm a sinful man.

35:12.120 --> 35:14.720
I don't know how to face all the promises I made.

35:16.330 --> 35:17.400
I just hope she

35:17.730 --> 35:19.270
can consider it a dream.

35:20.930 --> 35:22.590
The road is muddy in the dream.

35:22.890 --> 35:24.890
She'll see light after she wakes up.

35:25.180 --> 35:26.790
The world is desolate.

35:28.330 --> 35:29.870
Take care.

35:40.630 --> 35:42.580
You are so affectionate.

35:45.110 --> 35:47.370
You've become more and more like a human.

35:51.800 --> 35:53.420
What about you?

35:55.680 --> 35:57.830
You won't help me for no reason.

35:59.030 --> 36:00.390
What do you want?

36:05.150 --> 36:06.640
Why exactly

36:07.000 --> 36:08.720
did you help him?

36:10.500 --> 36:12.330
I told you long ago.

36:13.320 --> 36:14.850
I did it for the Baize Token.

36:16.800 --> 36:17.880
The Baize Token?

36:18.670 --> 36:19.710
Some dreams

36:20.020 --> 36:22.500
can remind you of the past that has been forgotten.

36:22.500 --> 36:24.310
Zhao Yuanzhou asked me

36:24.340 --> 36:26.270
to create a dream like that for you.

36:35.300 --> 36:38.260
Is everything I saw in my dream

36:45.700 --> 36:46.820
real?

36:52.440 --> 36:53.580
Yes.

36:56.000 --> 36:57.990
So you wanted Ran Yi

36:58.070 --> 36:59.380
to help me remember

36:59.410 --> 37:02.410
the whereabouts of the Baize Token through the dream?

37:04.560 --> 37:06.080
That was not a dream.

37:07.540 --> 37:08.970
It was your memory.

37:11.330 --> 37:13.730
But why was the memory missing from my mind?

37:26.850 --> 37:29.070
What did you see in the dream?

37:32.470 --> 37:33.770
I saw

37:34.670 --> 37:37.460
Master did give the Baize Token to me.

37:39.030 --> 37:42.030
There was indeed a Baize Mark on my forehead.

37:48.020 --> 37:49.110
Then how come

37:49.130 --> 37:51.670
you don't have Baize Divine Power at all?

37:59.550 --> 38:02.610
Maybe there's still something she hasn't remembered.

38:09.870 --> 38:11.040
Zhao Yuanzhou,

38:11.140 --> 38:12.720
I've fulfilled

38:12.760 --> 38:14.080
my promise to you.

38:14.340 --> 38:16.120
What about your promise to me?

38:19.990 --> 38:22.160
Master Qi has been punished.

38:23.630 --> 38:25.160
What about her freedom?

38:32.640 --> 38:33.740
Conjure.

38:48.910 --> 38:50.360
After tomorrow,

38:50.990 --> 38:52.030
everyone will think

38:52.030 --> 38:54.360
Miss Qi has been killed by the Water Ghost.

38:56.070 --> 38:57.110
She's free.

38:57.940 --> 39:00.250
She can go anywhere she wants.

39:03.040 --> 39:04.570
According to the book,

39:05.190 --> 39:06.850
the East Sea in the Wilderness

39:07.110 --> 39:08.840
has azure water and white sand.

39:12.630 --> 39:15.270
I really want to see it myself.

39:24.310 --> 39:25.270
Thank you.

39:28.520 --> 39:29.980
Since you've pled guilty,

39:30.000 --> 39:31.790
you should surrender

39:31.920 --> 39:34.520
and go back to the Demon Hunting Bureau with me.

39:35.640 --> 39:36.710
Someone is here.

40:04.270 --> 40:06.270
Didn't we hide her in the Archives?

40:06.870 --> 40:08.270
How did she come here?

40:08.960 --> 40:10.090
I didn't expect that

40:10.240 --> 40:11.370
you still came here.

40:26.140 --> 40:27.190
Where's Ran Yi?

40:34.010 --> 40:35.030
Zhuo, you...

40:36.870 --> 40:38.930
It can make sure she won't run around.

40:42.240 --> 40:43.120
Let's go.

41:08.040 --> 41:09.680
I know everything.

41:11.080 --> 41:13.010
Whether you're a human or a demon,

41:13.960 --> 41:15.550
no matter what you do,

41:17.550 --> 41:19.150
we'll live and die together,

41:20.010 --> 41:21.390
till death do us part.

41:45.210 --> 41:46.580
Let's leave together

41:46.830 --> 41:48.020
and go back to the Wilderness.

41:48.020 --> 41:48.810
Okay.

41:50.110 --> 41:52.450
You tried so hard to escape.

41:53.390 --> 41:54.840
Why do you want to go back?

41:57.070 --> 41:58.390
People say

41:59.430 --> 42:01.290
animals spend their entire lives

42:01.560 --> 42:04.890
seeking a roof to shelter them in order to eat and sleep well.

42:05.130 --> 42:06.570
But only humans

42:08.100 --> 42:10.370
yearn to return to their hometowns.

42:15.340 --> 42:17.570
I read a lot of books and wrote

42:18.690 --> 42:21.020
many Chinese characters with her before.

42:21.390 --> 42:24.250
But I still don't understand what homesickness is.

42:25.610 --> 42:26.920
If it's sorrow,

42:28.360 --> 42:30.420
why do so many people pursue it?

42:32.550 --> 42:33.960
Now I understand.

42:35.160 --> 42:36.840
I don't want to be an animal.

42:37.030 --> 42:38.380
I want to be a human.

42:38.960 --> 42:40.870
What about those people you hurt?

42:42.020 --> 42:43.550
They wanted to be humans too.

42:43.550 --> 42:45.720
They also wanted to return to their hometowns.

42:45.720 --> 42:47.320
You committed heinous crimes,

42:47.320 --> 42:49.450
yet you still want to leave unscathed?

43:01.920 --> 43:03.780
Your brother saved me back then.

43:04.020 --> 43:05.820
But today, you want to arrest me.

43:06.700 --> 43:09.350
I've protected you from nightmares for many years.

43:09.350 --> 43:10.670
I did you a favor.

43:10.700 --> 43:12.350
Can't you just let us go?

43:12.790 --> 43:13.990
The one my brother

43:14.170 --> 43:16.520
saved back then was surely a kind demon,

43:16.540 --> 43:18.580
not you who killed innocent people.

43:18.950 --> 43:21.010
I will arrest you.

43:22.860 --> 43:24.700
The only thing I can do

43:25.250 --> 43:27.050
is to plead

43:28.170 --> 43:29.570
for your life.

43:30.270 --> 43:31.040
Yes.

43:34.710 --> 43:36.470
I killed innocent people.

43:37.860 --> 43:40.590
But I created the most beautiful dreams for them.

43:41.620 --> 43:43.280
Their lives

43:43.360 --> 43:45.470
were full of pain and restraints.

43:46.900 --> 43:49.370
I gave them the happiness they longed for.

43:51.720 --> 43:53.110
Longed for.

43:56.900 --> 43:58.780
Words invented by humans

43:58.980 --> 44:01.070
are perfectly apt sometimes.

44:02.800 --> 44:04.260
What is elusive in reality

44:06.040 --> 44:07.520
can be found in dreams.

44:10.740 --> 44:12.230
Life is

44:12.300 --> 44:14.500
like Zhuangzi and his butterfly dream.

44:14.750 --> 44:15.750
In the dreams,

44:16.070 --> 44:17.910
all their wishes came true.

44:18.630 --> 44:20.760
They lived their happy lives in the way

44:21.010 --> 44:22.830
they wanted the most.

44:24.270 --> 44:25.470
Isn't that good?

44:27.280 --> 44:29.080
Whether it's a dream or reality,

44:29.310 --> 44:31.640
it's not for you to decide on their behalf.

44:33.430 --> 44:34.630
I don't want to be a demon.

44:34.630 --> 44:35.710
I want to be a human.

44:36.100 --> 44:37.930
Who should decide it?

44:38.630 --> 44:39.620
You?

44:40.590 --> 44:42.150
Baize Goddess.

44:45.780 --> 44:47.840
Mayflies can see the sun and the moon,

44:48.210 --> 44:50.270
but she can only stay in her room,

44:50.450 --> 44:52.040
subject to the whims of fate.

44:52.040 --> 44:53.750
Who gave her a choice?

44:54.840 --> 44:56.300
Nature is not benevolent.

44:56.580 --> 44:58.630
It treats all things as sacrificial straw dogs.

44:58.630 --> 45:00.760
Just because nature is not benevolent,

45:00.760 --> 45:02.950
justice prevails

45:03.300 --> 45:04.840
beneath the weight of fate.

45:11.150 --> 45:13.610
How will the Demon Hunting Bureau punish me?

45:14.010 --> 45:16.350
Although Master Qi hurt you first,

45:17.300 --> 45:19.670
you killed dozens of people after all.

45:19.870 --> 45:21.130
You are unforgivable.

45:22.000 --> 45:24.600
You'll be imprisoned for at least 1,000 years.

45:24.710 --> 45:25.790
1,000 years?

45:31.070 --> 45:33.100
You humans are so arrogant.

45:33.610 --> 45:34.790
For demons,

45:35.190 --> 45:36.400
it's bearable.

45:37.660 --> 45:39.150
But for humans,

45:41.020 --> 45:42.820
life is just a few short decades.

45:43.230 --> 45:44.390
In other words,

45:44.750 --> 45:45.910
I can't see you again

45:46.990 --> 45:48.950
even in the next life.

46:01.690 --> 46:03.270
I refuse to accept that.

46:04.260 --> 46:06.310
It's not up to you.
